2026-11-10T05:48:56.2735337Z with:
2026-11-10T05:48:56.2735572Z   fetch-depth: 0
2026-11-10T05:48:56.2735833Z   ref: 0cf6a17ae4f2fbac36fbaa2e4d64a4e6ceb704bf
2026-11-10T05:48:56.2736241Z   repository: patrick-hudson/put.gd-desktop
2026-11-10T05:48:56.2738681Z   token: ***
2026-11-10T05:48:56.2738851Z   ssh-strict: true
2026-11-10T05:48:56.2739013Z   ssh-user: git
